      <mri:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>The Digital Geological Map data covering Korea peninsular is available
          in this OGC WMS service for your personal, non-commercial use only and is being served as
          a contribution to the OneGeology initiative(www.onegeology.org). Separate bedrock
          geological deposits layer is available in this service. For information about more of the
          Korea Institute of Geoscience &amp; Mineral Resources's maps that are available digitally
          please visit https://data.kigam.re.kr/eng"</gco:CharacterString>
      </mri:abstract>
